        <body>
            <div xml:id="d105">

                <pb facs="0216" n="136" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg136"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Swenson to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-03-26"><hi rendition="#italic">March 26,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 197.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to transmit herewith
                    copies of the correspondence in the military-service case of Sören Laurids
                    Sörensen, a former Dane, naturalized in the United States, who, upon his return
                    to Denmark, has been summoned for military duty.</p>
                <p>I respectfully submit my report without any further comment, as the facts in the
                    case are fully set forth in the inclosures herewith.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Laurits S.
                    Swenson.</hi></signed></closer>












